The NEWS file for the easpanel package.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc1 - 23 June 2026

New Applet. Added a directp(1) applet for fully automatic direct file
insertions.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc0 - 12 June 2026

Update the Qt dependency to use Qt5.

Added Flatpak support.

Added DEB packaging support.

Added support for 'BLU' (Blue Alert) and 'MEP' (Missing and Endnagered Person)
event code support.

Added support for direct file imports.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.0.0rc0 - 1 October 2020

Initial release candidate.

